# ─── Secrets held in config files (#448) ──
# The Redis password lives in a conf file the container reads at runtime, not in `--requirepass`
# on the command line, because Compose bakes an interpolated flag into the container config where
# `docker inspect` prints it back. The filled-in file must never be committed; the template that
# documents it is infra/redis.conf.example.
redis.conf
